<Slide style={{ width:'1280px', height:'720px', padding:'60px', background:'#FFFFFF', fontFamily:'Microsoft YaHei', display:'flex', flexDirection:'column' }}>
<Box style={{ height:46, flexDirection:'row', alignItems:'center', justifyContent:'space-between' }}><Box style={{ flexDirection:'row', alignItems:'baseline', gap:18 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 32, color: '#14563F', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.2 }}>数据设计：12 张业务表</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#5A6B61', lineHeight: 1.4 }}>第 4.7 节 · 76 个数据元素 → 12 张表</Text></Box><Box style={{ flexDirection:'row', alignItems:'center', gap:12 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#5A6B61', lineHeight: 1.4 }}>FTDMS · 总体设计报告</Text><Image src="assets/logo_icon.png" style={{ width: 36, height: 36, objectFit: 'contain' }} /></Box></Box>
<Box style={{ height:1, background:'#CFD9D2', marginTop:8, marginBottom:20 }}></Box>
<Box style={{ height:462, flexDirection:'column', gap:18 }}><Box style={{ height:240, flexDirection:'row', gap:36 }}><Box style={{ flex:1, flexDirection:'column', gap:10, padding:'0 4px' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 22, color: '#14563F', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.3 }}>三条设计重点</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#1C2A24', lineHeight: 1.4 }}>私有数据一律带 user_id，读写按令牌身份过滤<br />日期查询建联合索引 idx(user_id, record_date)<br />历史事实保存快照：食物库变更不改写历史<br />多表写入使用事务；同日体重由唯一键 upsert 兜底</Text></Box><Box style={{ flex:1, flexDirection:'column', gap:10, padding:'0 4px' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 22, color: '#14563F', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.3 }}>12 张业务表分组</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#1C2A24', lineHeight: 1.4 }}>账户：user_account、daily_goal<br />训练：exercise、training_plan、plan_item、workout_log、workout_set<br />饮食与身体：food、diet_record、body_record<br />AI：ai_consent、ai_report</Text></Box></Box><Box style={{ height:204, flexDirection:'column', gap:0 }}><Box style={{ height:51, flexDirection:'row', gap:20, alignItems:'center', borderBottom:'1px solid #CFD9D2', padding:'0 6px' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#14563F', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.3, width: 140 }}>归属联系</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#1C2A24', lineHeight: 1.4 }}>user_account 与 7 张私有表为 1:N；plan_id 可空表示临时训练</Text></Box><Box style={{ height:51, flexDirection:'row', gap:20, alignItems:'center', borderBottom:'1px solid #CFD9D2', padding:'0 6px' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#14563F', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.3, width: 140 }}>唯一键三处</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#1C2A24', lineHeight: 1.4 }}>username、(user_id, effective_date)、(user_id, record_date)</Text></Box><Box style={{ height:51, flexDirection:'row', gap:20, alignItems:'center', borderBottom:'1px solid #CFD9D2', padding:'0 6px' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#14563F', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.3, width: 140 }}>不落库</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#1C2A24', lineHeight: 1.4 }}>D13 统计汇总为视图不作实体；ai_report 支持物理删除</Text></Box><Box style={{ height:51, flexDirection:'row', gap:20, alignItems:'center', padding:'0 6px' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#14563F', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.3, width: 140 }}>输入与校验</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#1C2A24', lineHeight: 1.4 }}>SRS 附录 A 的 76 元素 + FAR 附录 E 数据字典；40 条校验规则按接口文档索引</Text></Box></Box></Box>
<Box style={{ height:50, marginTop:9, background:'#F4F8F5', flexDirection:'row', alignItems:'center', padding:'0 20px' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#1C2A24', lineHeight: 1.4 }}>数据设计把「口径正确」落到表结构：归属、索引、快照三件事可逐条验收。</Text></Box>
</Slide>
